1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,263
Let's see it live.

2
00:00:01,263 --> 00:00:04,260
I connect my wallet on the Coston2 testnet,

3
00:00:04,260 --> 00:00:06,304
and enter a sample portfolio.

4
00:00:06,304 --> 00:00:09,292
When I click run, the app encrypts everything

5
00:00:09,292 --> 00:00:12,540
locally, nothing leaves the browser in plaintext.

6
00:00:12,540 --> 00:00:15,747
Now it registers the analysis task on-chain.

7
00:00:15,747 --> 00:00:18,872
The encrypted payload goes to the TEE node,

8
00:00:18,872 --> 00:00:22,282
which performs the analysis inside the enclave.

9
00:00:22,282 --> 00:00:23,722
And here is the result.

10
00:00:23,722 --> 00:00:27,407
Risk score, per-asset rebalancing advice, and a

11
00:00:27,407 --> 00:00:31,399
summary, decrypted locally, and only visible to me.

